# Copy to /etc/nota/backup.env (root, mode 600). No secrets here: the rclone config lives only on the server
# (~root/.config/rclone/rclone.conf, created by `rclone config`).
#
# Off-server copy of every daily backup. <remote> is the name you gave in `rclone config`.
# Examples:  gdrive:nota-backups      b2:my-bucket/nota
# Empty or missing = no off-server copy (the backup job logs a warning every day).
NOTA_RCLONE_REMOTE=
